                <div class="post-excerpt"><p>If there is one jacket to buy this fall season, it is definitely a barn jacket. They are EVERYWHERE and there are so many different price points, colorways and styles to choose from. Barn jackets are a style that have been around for yearssss and go by various names such as chore jacket, utility jacket, etc.</p>
