                <div class="post-excerpt"><p>I love all lip products from lipsticks, to lip oils, glosses and lacquers. But the one lip product that I&#8217;ve never used consistently are lip liners. It felt like an unnecessary extra step most of the time&#8230;&#8230;until I reached my mid-40&#8217;s</p>
