                <div class="post-excerpt"><p>The month before fall officially begins and the first few weeks of fall can be a tricky time in terms of deciding what to wear. It&#8217;s chilly in the mornings but warm in the afternoons. I have a few key pieces in my closet that I reach for during this time that are perfect for this in-between weather.</p>
